## ⭐ Project Goal

The goal of this project is to demonstrate how **LangGraph, LangChain, LLMs, FastAPI, Pydantic, and Next.js** can be combined to build a simple end-to-end AI application.

It is intentionally kept simple so that the architecture and AI workflow are easy to understand and extend.
